:: Fishing Forest Lake Rock Slip
<<effects>>
<<run stopFishingProp()>>
As you're shifting your weight, the slippery rocks give way beneath you <span class="red">and you tumble into the lake.</span>
<br><br>

<<if $rng gte 80>>
	You manage to keep hold of your rod as you go over.
<<else>>
	Your rod slips from your hands as you fall, sinking into the dark depths of the lake. <<handheldruined>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Lake Depths]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
